        "original_id": "de71e02a-6517-5fec-b3b8-b8cbe47ae1d7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Mafalda of Savoy, Umberto II of Italy, Victor Emmanuel III, Elena of Montenegro\n- Roles: King of Italy, head of state\n\nFacts:\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy was born on 2 November 1902 and died on 27 August 1944.\n- Umberto II of Italy was born on 15 September 1904 and died on 18 March 1983.\n- Princess Mafalda of Savoy was the second daughter of King Victor Emmanuel III of Italy and his wife Elena of Montenegro.\n- Umberto II of Italy was the younger brother of Princess Mafalda of Savoy.\n- Umberto II of Italy was the last King of Italy.\n- Umberto II of Italy was the de facto head of state of Italy from 1944.\n- Umberto II of Italy reigned from 9 May 1946 to 12 June 1946 for 34 days.\n- Umberto II of Italy was nicknamed the May King.",
